DTEND:20201003T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052443Z
UID:4pj17720id50ci6fofhcejdmnv@google.com
CREATED:20200929T133832Z
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin Orwell writer Emily Arnason Casey for two Saturdays of w
 riting about nature and place.\nFrom 10-12AM on the first two Saturdays in 
 October\, writers of any level will convene in local nature\nand consider t
 he way an intimacy with place and nature influences their perceptions of th
 e world around them. \nThe group will take a short walk\, engage in writing
 \, and share with each other. \nMeet ups will take place at the Orwell LIbr
 ary & Mount Independence\, weather permitting. \nPlease contact Emily for m
 ore information.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200929T133833Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:A Field Guide to Writing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
