CREATED:20211008T191102Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Discuss "Look to the Mountain" by LeGrand Cannon Jr. at 1
 2:30pm and stay for the lecture\, A Signal Victory: Bennington\, August 16\
 , 1777\, at 2pm.  The lecture\, by Ennis Duling\, is centered on people and
  their personalities\, especially John Stark of New Hampshire and Seth Warn
 er of Vermont. He will connect the battle to Le Grand Cannon Jr.’s novel Lo
 ok to the Mountain and to events at Mount Independence.</span><br><span>&nb
 sp\;Collaboration with Mount Independence Coalition.&nbsp\;</span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211008T191129Z
LOCATION:Mount Independence\, Mt Independence\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Book Discussion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
