DESCRIPTION:Join Fort Ticonderoga Director of Interpretation\, Cameron Gree
 n\, to explore the community that developed around Ticonderoga on the eve o
 f the American Revolution. Learn what was happening both at Fort Ticonderog
 a and in the surrounding area on the eve of the America's First Victory on 
 May 10\, 1775! Discover what we know about these early settlers and how the
  American War for Independence effected their livelihood.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250114T133248Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Ticonderoga's Neighborhood of 1775
TRANSP:OPAQUE
