CREATED:20251212T164807Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><p><span>William B. Hart\, Professor Emeritus of Hi
 story at Middlebury College\,</span><span> will speak about the extraordina
 ry life and times of Alexander Lucius Twilight (1795-1857)\, an 1823 gradua
 te of Middlebury College. Topics include Twilight’s childhood\; his educati
 on\; his careers\; Twilight’s racial identity and representations of him\; 
 and more. Come learn about this remarkable individual who broke barriers\, 
 established precedents\, and made history.</span></p>
