CREATED:20250122T132756Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join the Orwell Historical Society for an "Orwell School
 s Info Night" where we'll dig into the history of the Orwell Schools. OHS i
 s collecting information about all of the dozen Orwell schoolhouses\, from 
 their size and location and what it was like to attend\, to what happened o
 nce they closed. The Orwell Museum will display school related photographs\
 , maps\, journals and documents from its collection and we encourage you to
  bring your own artifacts and stories to add to the history. A scanner will
  be on hand. All are welcome!
LAST-MODIFIED:20250123T221614Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library\, 473 Main St\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Schoolhouse Info Night\, Orwell Historical Society
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
