CREATED:20190716T232645Z
DESCRIPTION:Children ages 6 to 10 are invited to come to Mount Independence
  State Historic Site in Orwell\, VT\, on Wednesday\, July 24\, 2019\, for a
 n hour of Revolutionary story time and experiences from 10:30 to 11:30. Bri
 ng your responsible adult with you. It will be an hour of stories\, hands-o
 n activities and simple crafts\, and some outdoor time if the weather permi
 ts. A family donation of $5.00 is suggested.\nCall (802) 948-2000 for more 
 information. A second one is planned for August 21 at 10:30 am.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190717T233318Z
LOCATION:Mount Independence\, Mt Independence\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mount Independence Experience
TRANSP:OPAQUE
