DESCRIPTION:<b><p>I hope this time works for a video meeting on Google Meet
 ! Please feel free to propose another time if needed.</p></b><br><br>Hi Kat
 e Hunter\,<br><br>Thank you for submitting your projectConnect request to I
 TDRC for Orwell Free Library (Orwell Free Library)! Our non-profit is excit
 ed to provide free-of-charge community WiFi installations to support educat
 ional needs\, employment resources\, digital banking\, telemedicine\, voter
  registration and much more.<br><br>Someone from our team will reach out to
  schedule a video call to discuss how we can support your community's needs
 . We aim to respond to most requests within 48 hours. In the meantime\, we 
 have additional information in our Frequently Asked Questions document. If 
 you have any questions\, please reply to projectconnect@itdrc.org.<br><br>B
 est regards\,<br>ITDRC projectConnect<br>--<br>If you are looking for suppo
 rt with a non-COVID-19 emergency such as a wildfire or hurricane\, please c
 ontact us at support@itdrc.org.\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.goog
 le.com/mae-coud-ris\nOr dial: (US) +1 541-626-6051 PIN: 376180673#\nMore ph
 one numbers: https://tel.meet/mae-coud-ris?pin=1805941512407&hs=7\n\nLearn 
 more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
