UID:33uthlfa03q4gpf5ud07dq0kpt@google.com
CREATED:20220811T205707Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr"><i>D</i>o you feel like you were (or are currently
  being) poorly advised about what’s normal vs. not normal with your body af
 ter having a baby? Is returning to exercise not going quite as planned? Do 
 you have symptoms you know are related to childbirth\, just to be dismissed
  and told it’s “normal”? Maybe you have had a baby a while ago\, but your b
 ody feels older than you actually are because you can’t stop peeing or havi
 ng pain/discomfort? You are not alone.</p><p dir="ltr">You are invited to j
 oin Dr. Davida Murray\, PT\, DPT\, owner of New Moon Physical Therapy and p
 elvic floor physical therapist/pregnancy and post-partum corrective exercis
 e specialist\, in a 1 hour hands-on workshop <b>to learn what’s normal and 
 not-normal after having a baby\, no matter how long ago it’s been</b>. You 
 will leave this workshop knowing foundational exercises that will give you 
 an excellent start to feeling your best again. You will also have the knowl
 edge about what can be done to make you feel ready to be as active as you w
 ant to- comfortably.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T040353Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library\, 473 Main St\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:What you were never told\, but need to know about your postpartum b
 ody
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
