DESCRIPTION:Join the Mount Independence Coalition and the Orwell Free Libra
 ry for this talk by author\, historian and Coalition board member Ennis Dul
 ing about the Battle of Bennington. The talk&nbsp\;will be centered on peop
 le and their personalities\, especially John Stark of New Hampshire and Set
 h Warner of Vermont. The talk is given in conjunction with the Orwell Free 
 Library reading program and connected to the book <a href="https://wwnorton
 .com/books/Look-to-the-Mountain">Look to the Mountain</a>\, by Legrand Cann
 on\, Jr.
