DTEND:20270122T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T052443Z
UID:34qkmomtsu0p1qekreid4buhg6@google.com
CREATED:20261023T134957Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span>You probably pass by your local cemetery every day—but
  did you know that the images carved into those stones contain secret messa
 ges? Vermont Book Award Winner and folklorist GennaRose Nethercott will tea
 ch you to crack the codes hidden in old New England gravestone art… plus di
 scuss the elaborate\, eccentric\, and downright eerie burial practices Puri
 tan New Englanders participated in while entombing their dead—from purple g
 loves to mirror magic. </span></p><p><span>And as the final nail in the cof
 fin? We’ll learn the true tales behind some of Vermont’s very strangest gra
 vestones.</span></p><p><span> Part of the 2027 Orwell &amp\; Shoreham Keyno
 te Speakers Series. </span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T134957Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library\, 473 Main St\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Grave Secrets of the Green Moutains
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
