CREATED:20240517T183557Z
DESCRIPTION:Watch Secrets in Your Data together then discuss the impacts of
  big data  and data security on our lives.\n\nMore about the documentary: W
 hether you’re on social media or surfing the web\,\nyou’re probably sharing
  more personal data than you\nrealize. That can pose a risk to your privacy
 —even your\nsafety. But at the same time\, big datasets could lead to\nhuge
  advances in fields like medicine. Host Alok Patel\nleads a quest to unders
 tand what happens to all the data\nwe’re shedding and explores the latest e
 fforts to maximize\nthe benefits—without compromising our personal privacy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240917T163110Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library\, 473 Main St\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Secrets in Your Data Documentary Screening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
