DESCRIPTION:<p><b>History Club</b> will meet for six weeks\, every Tuesday 
 at 3pm beginning February 6th\, to haunt the halls of history\, examine the
  evidence and question the past in search of hidden treasure—including buri
 ed information\, tales of inspiration\, pearls of perspective\, and forgott
 en heroes. <i>History\, it’s personal! Join us and find out what it means t
 o you.</i> </p><p>Attendance open to 8 students\, fourth through sixth grad
 e\, sponsored by the Orwell Free Library in partnership with the Orwell His
 torical Society. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240119T192733Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:History Club
TRANSP:OPAQUE
