DESCRIPTION:<p>When:<b>Nov 4\, 2023\, 10 AM to 2 PM</b><br>Where:<b>Orwell 
 Town Hall\, Main Street\, Orwell\, VT</b></p><p>A free community fair all a
 bout Lake Champlain for kids and adults. Step onto the Giant Lake Champlain
  Map\, get a close look at the watershed using a watershed model\, see some
  invasive species\, learn about the fight for clean water\, join some fishy
  art-making\, enjoy local snacks\, and more!</p>
