 ge SPORE lab  for a free mushroom walk at Orwell Free Library starting at 9
  AM\, August 1st. Middlebury College Spore lab aims to engage community vol
 unteers to collect and organize data for fungal biodiversity in Vermont. Du
 ring the mushroom walk\, learn about local fungi\, hear more about the Sequ
 ence Vermont project and get free sampling materials.<br> <br><a href="http
 s://sequencevermont.org/">https://sequencevermont.org/</a>
