CREATED:20220820T144922Z
DESCRIPTION:Presented by psychologist Rae Anne Barry\, PHD\n\nHealth profes
 sionals and the general public tend to experience a mixed reaction to hypno
 sis - a curiosity tainted with skepticism and misapprehension. But hypnosis
  can be a powerful tool for mental health. Dr. Barry will address the commo
 n misconceptions and myths surrounding the practice and its many positive c
 linical uses. The presentation will end with a Q & A session.
LAST-MODIFIED:20220820T164955Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library\, 473 Main St\, Orwell\, VT 05760\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hypnosis Myths and Truths
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
