DESCRIPTION:January event will be on the second Saturday of the month!\nImm
 erse your little ones (ages 3-6) in the joy of music with early childhood m
 usic educator\, Anna Laufenberg! Through hands-on instrument exploration\, 
 interactive sing-alongs\, and creative movement\, cultivate a love for musi
 c while fostering creativity. This free monthly program is created for chil
 dren ages 3-6. Families with multi-aged children are welcome to participate
 .
