DESCRIPTION:Join local artist Beth Murphy for a morning of creating with pr
 essed flowers. Beth will provide<br />all materials to create a card and bo
 okmark from her collection of pressed flowers\, leaves and<br />all things 
 botanical. Bring your creativity and celebrate that spring is coming soon!<
 br />About the artist: Beth Murphy creates mixed media collages with presse
 d botanicals\, papers\,<br />and paint. She is a member of the Brandon Arti
 sts Guild and the Orwell Artists\, and her work<br />has appeared in a numb
 er of local exhibits. Beth lives on Lake Bomoseen where she also has<br />h
 er studio which will be open to the public during the Vermont Open Studio T
 our weekend\,<br />May 27 and 28 th . You can see her work on her website <
 a href="http://www.bethmurphybotanicals.com.">www.bethmurphybotanicals.com.
 </a><br /><br><br /><br>Registration is required for this event. Check back
  in mid-February for registration details.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230120T205837Z
LOCATION:Orwell Free Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bring on Spring Flowers!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
